; A startup bundle for one member, or for anyone, on a stick.
FORM BUNDLE_MAKE
TITLE Make a startup bundle
SUMMARY Builds a signed bundle of the station book, channels, schedules and forms. Made for one member whose card you checked, it carries the frequencies sealed to that member.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 60
ACTION bundle_make
FIELD for For member(@cards)
FIELD label Label(X) upper max=40
FIELD out Write it to(X) check=path
NEXT BUNDLE_SEND
BEGIN_HELP
For member:
Leave it empty for a bundle anyone can load, with no frequencies.
END

Write it to:
A file on a stick, such as /media/stick/region.pnb. Leave it empty to only see it.
END
